narration
  id: Tasya dateng ke warung Bu Sari jam sepuluh lewat, bawa es kopi literan yang udah berembun. Rambutnya diiket asal. Matanya bengkak, tapi lipstiknya rapi.
  en: Tasya arrives at Bu Sari's stall just after ten, carrying a giant iced coffee already beaded with water. Her hair is tied up any old way. Her eyes are puffy, but her lipstick is perfect.

stage
  show tasya:nervous right transition=slide_left duration=700

tasya:nervous [right] [if trust_tasya >= 0]
  id: Hai. Sori telat. Gue muter tiga kali di gang, nggak berani masuk.
  en: Hi. Sorry I'm late. I circled the alley three times, too scared to come in.
tasya:defensive [right] [if trust_tasya < 0]
  id: Gue dateng karena Dinda yang minta. Bukan karena lo.
  en: I came because Dinda asked. Not because of you.
dinda:neutral [center]
  id: Duduk, Kak. Bu Sari udah bikinin teh.
  en: Sit down. Bu Sari made you tea.

narration
  id: Tasya duduk di ujung bangku plastik, jauh dari gue. Es kopinya nggak diminum, cuma diputer-puter.
  en: Tasya sits at the very end of the plastic bench, far from me. She doesn't drink her iced coffee, just turns it round and round.

tasya:guilty
  id: Gue belum cerita semuanya. Waktu orang PR itu nelpon, dia nggak cuma nawarin duit.
  en: I haven't told you everything. When that PR guy called, he didn't just offer money.
tasya:guilty
  id: Dia nanya, "Selain Mbak Sekar, siapa lagi yang tahu soal dokumennya?" Kayak... dia udah tahu ada dokumen. Gue bahkan belum tahu waktu itu.
  en: He asked, "Apart from Ms. Sekar, who else knows about the documents?" Like... he already knew there were documents. I didn't even know yet.
tasya:nervous
  id: Terus dia bilang, "Kami sudah dengar dari orang dekatnya." Gue kira maksudnya gue. Biar gue ngerasa bersalah. Dan berhasil.
  en: Then he said, "We've already heard from someone close to her." I thought he meant me. To make me feel guilty. And it worked.
raka:worried
  id: Orang dekatnya.
  en: Someone close to her.

choice SHOW_PAGE by=tasya:guilty [if clue_notebook_page == true]
