@conversation d5n_bima chapter="Hari 5" chapter.en="Day 5" title="Orang Dekatnya" title.en="Someone Close to Her"
@scene VN bg=bg_sekar_house_gate_night.webp music=bgm_unease.mp3 ambience=amb_room_night.mp3 day=5 time=18:40

narration
  id: Bima dateng pas magrib. Tanpa martabak kali ini. Mobil peraknya diparkir di mulut gang, jauh, kayak dia nggak mau mobilnya kelihatan di depan rumah ini.
  en: Bima comes at sunset. No martabak this time. He parks his silver car at the mouth of the alley, far away, as if he doesn't want it seen outside this house.

stage
  show raka:neutral left
  show dinda:neutral center
  show bima:neutral right transition=fade duration=700

bima:ashamed [right] [if bima_leak_planted == true]
  id: Gue bilang mau ngomong yang bener. Jadi gue di sini.
  en: I said I'd tell you properly. So here I am.
bima:irritated [right] [if bima_leak_planted != true]
  id: Tasya bilang lo mau ketemu. Gue nggak punya banyak waktu, Ka.
  en: Tasya said you wanted to meet. I don't have much time, Ka.

dinda:angry [center]
  id: Seseorang ngasih tahu Bentang kalau Kak Sekar punya dokumen itu. Sebelum dia ngilang. Sebelum ada yang ngancem.
  en: Someone told Bentang that Sekar had those documents. Before she disappeared. Before anyone threatened anyone.
raka:neutral [left]
  id: Didit bilang ke Tasya, dia udah denger dari orang dekatnya. Jadi sekarang kita mau tahu siapa.
  en: Didit told Tasya he'd already heard from someone close to her. So now we want to know who.

evidence WHO_LEAKED by=raka:determined label=who_leaked
  id: Siapa yang ngasih tahu Bentang? Tunjukkan buktinya.
  en: Who told Bentang? Show the proof.
? didit_card
  +trust_bima 2
  -> #leak_bima
